Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:26:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the actual shareable referral link + manual code entry at
 checkout
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Two real gaps from the previous commit, not config issues:
- Partner dashboard showed the raw code but never a shareable URL
  (https://passthrough.dev/?ref=CODE) — added with a copy-to-clipboard
  button, on both the partner dashboard and the admin panel.
- There was no way to APPLY a code by typing it — only automatic ?ref=
  URL capture worked. Added a 'have a referral code?' entry field to
  FixBanner, wired through ScanResult as real state (not just a
  storage read) so typing a code updates the displayed price
  immediately and is what actually gets charged.
---
